---
import Header from '../../components/header/index.astro'
import SEO from '../../components/seo/index.astro'
import { ClientRouter } from 'astro:transitions'
import '../../style/index.css'
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <SEO title="Work with me" description="Work with Emmanuel Obiabo on web and mobile products, APIs, integrations, and developer tools." />
    <ClientRouter />
  </head>
  <body class="editorial-page">
    <Header />
    <main class="page-shell work-content">
      <h1>Work with me</h1>

      <p>
        I'm Emmanuel, a software engineer working across web and mobile products, APIs, and developer tools.
        I mainly use TypeScript and Rust, and I like the point where a clean interface depends on solid systems underneath.
      </p>

      <p>
        Recent GitHub work includes
        <a href="https://github.com/KPpay-project/K-polygone-application/pull/197" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">merchant gateway tools</a>,
        <a href="https://github.com/ourpocket/infra/pull/25" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">payment-provider APIs</a>,
        <a href="https://github.com/tupui/soroban-versioning/pull/224" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Stellar identity tooling</a>,
        and a <a href="https://github.com/theobiabo/cNGN-rs" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Rust SDK for cNGN</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What I can help with</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Building features end to end, from interface to API.</li>
        <li>Designing integrations and SDKs that are clear to use.</li>
        <li>Improving existing systems and developer workflows.</li>
      </ol>

      <p class="work-contact">
        I'm open to full-time roles and focused contracts. Have a concrete problem? <a href="/reach">Get in touch</a>.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .work-content {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  ol {
    list-style: decimal;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  li + li {
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
  }

  a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;
  }

  a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .work-contact {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
